Ghosts are very slow.  Take advantage of the movement system.
Count the number of whacks you get in before ghost hits.  Then
do one fewer whack and step back.  Instead of hitting the ghost
will follow you.  You'll be able to do maybe 3-4 hits before each
retreat and the ghost is toast after a few cycles.

> However being frozen in fear every time a ghost turns up can
> be nasty, especially seeing as there's no defence against that.

And it happens as soon as you step in the doorway so you
can't close the door.  Basically make sure the coast is clear
and hope nothing that fast is spawned.

> Without a priest to donate to, you should abandoned the protection run-
